My character is pretty tough (as he should be when dealing with the
Wizard).  Max stats, all intrinsics, reflection, speed, +6 Vorpal
Blade, regeneration etc. etc.  But the wizards needs special
treatment:

To nail the Wizard my character polymorphs into a Marilith.  Then with
the Vorpal Blade and six blows per attack he can deliver around 100
hitpoints worth of damage.  Two attacks should normally be enough to
kill the wizard.  The problem is that it takes time to polymorph (and
can be risky) so he carries a couple of tins with chameleon meat
together with his ring of polymorph control.  My character hasn't been
able to eat the ring to get intrinsic polymorph control since the ring
isn't made of the right material.

